WEBVTT

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.973
and zoonotic viruses like the coronavirus.

00:04:33.376 --> 00:04:37.726
I know some are concerned
with this transition,

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:41.820
and I want to tell them
these concerns are legitimate.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:43.906
But we have the knowledge,

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.136
we have the technology,

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:48.801
we have now the resources
to accompany this change

00:04:48.825 --> 00:04:51.338
and make this transition just.

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:55.856
We are directing our recovery
in this direction.

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:58.068
If we get it right,

00:04:58.092 --> 00:05:02.856
a third of our recovery money,
called Next Generation EU,